cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the article under
  "preferred-citation". To refer to the algorithm for the efficient
  computation of isotonic distributional regression, or to the estimator
  for right-censored responses (S-IDR), please cite the corresponding
  entry under "references".
title: "isodistrreg: Isotonic Distributional Regression"
abstract: >-
  Distributional regression under stochastic order restrictions for numeric
  and binary response variables and partially ordered covariates, including
  right-censored responses via Survival-IDR. Implemented in Rust, with
  bindings for Python and R.
type: software
version: 0.5.2
